  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msqrt><msup><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msqrt><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>tangent</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Equation of tangent&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>30</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Perpendicular distance from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>30</mn></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math></p>"
